Description: Open local images in digiKam without importing or modifying them
 Reuse the existing DImg preview widget and its shared stereo adapter for files
 passed on the command line. Keep the ordinary collection startup when no file
 is given, and destroy preview loading threads before cleaning up their cache.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed

